Nature is a mysterious creature.

00:34:28.130 --> 00:34:30.130
Have you talked to Lana?

00:34:30.130 --> 00:34:32.130
No, we dance to this tune before, Clark.

00:34:32.130 --> 00:34:34.130
I'm not playing Pickle in the middle anymore, remember?

00:34:34.130 --> 00:34:36.130
I know, but this time it's different.

00:34:36.130 --> 00:34:38.130
Lana's getting too close to finding out my secret.

00:34:38.130 --> 00:34:40.130
I mean, what am I supposed to do?

00:34:40.130 --> 00:34:44.130
Clark, Lana risked her life by not showing that photograph to Lex.

00:34:44.130 --> 00:34:46.130
She did that to protect you.

00:34:46.130 --> 00:34:50.130
I think she's proven where her loyalty lies.

00:34:50.130 --> 00:34:55.860
Yo, C.K. Thanks for fixing me up with a sucker's cocktail

00:34:55.860 --> 00:34:57.860
and Esposito's dark run.

00:34:57.860 --> 00:34:59.860
I help you out.

00:34:59.860 --> 00:35:01.860
Leave me holding a bag for a felony. It's great.

00:35:01.860 --> 00:35:04.860
Jimmy, I'm sorry. After I found out what happened to Lana,

00:35:04.860 --> 00:35:05.860
just wanted to make sure she was okay.

00:35:05.860 --> 00:35:16.940
Yeah, I can understand that urge.

00:35:16.940 --> 00:35:21.750
How is she?

00:35:21.750 --> 00:35:26.349
She's good, thanks to you. You really came through.

00:35:26.349 --> 00:35:34.210
Yeah, thanks.

00:35:34.210 --> 00:35:35.210
You guys should catch up.

00:35:35.210 --> 00:35:49.820
You know, he's not such a bad guy.

00:35:49.820 --> 00:35:56.849
Yeah. But he's no Jimmy Olson.

00:35:56.849 --> 00:37:09.699
Does that mean that you miss me?

00:37:09.699 --> 00:37:18.090
Farless, I fell, not...

00:37:18.090 --> 00:37:19.090
Everything's okay.

00:37:19.090 --> 00:37:28.460
Security Chief Luther Court Plaza said you never made it there.

00:37:28.460 --> 00:37:37.139
I went to the key.

00:37:37.139 --> 00:37:42.510
Kent Farm instead. Lex, you weren't here and I had to trust my instincts.

00:37:42.510 --> 00:37:44.510
You taught me that.

00:37:44.510 --> 00:37:51.349
And those instincts led you to the place your ex-boyfriend happens to live.

00:37:51.349 --> 00:37:59.860
I went to the Kent Farm because I thought it was the last place anyone would look for me.

00:37:59.860 --> 00:38:02.860
It's the only reason.

00:38:02.860 --> 00:38:08.599
That's good enough for me.

00:38:08.599 --> 00:39:17.260
Of anything else, I trust you.

00:39:17.260 --> 00:39:19.260
Looks like you're working out some issues there.

00:39:19.260 --> 00:39:23.539
Just doing a little honest work, Lex.

00:39:23.539 --> 00:39:25.539
You should try it sometime.

00:39:25.539 --> 00:39:28.539
Why start now?

00:39:28.539 --> 00:39:30.880
My life's perfect.

00:39:30.880 --> 00:39:40.030
And I just wanted to take a little sleigh ride down memory lane,

00:39:40.030 --> 00:39:42.030
visit the scene of the crime.

00:39:42.030 --> 00:39:47.030
Hey, there's where he took my fiancé after kidnapping her.

00:39:47.030 --> 00:39:53.329
Right before you tried to kill me.

00:39:53.329 --> 00:40:01.900
I wasn't myself that night. I'm sorry.

00:40:01.900 --> 00:40:02.900
Sorry.

00:40:02.900 --> 00:40:05.900
Well, they didn't finish the job?

00:40:05.900 --> 00:40:13.670
I'm still a bit fuzzy on the details, but with you trying to choke the life out of me.

00:40:13.670 --> 00:40:17.670
But what fascinates me is how after all that,

00:40:17.670 --> 00:40:20.670
how after all that, Lana could still feel safe coming here.

00:40:20.670 --> 00:40:22.670
That was her choice.

00:40:22.670 --> 00:40:24.670
I had nothing to do with it.

00:40:24.670 --> 00:40:25.670
You never do.

00:40:25.670 --> 00:40:28.670
That's all right.

00:40:28.670 --> 00:40:33.670
You see, I understand the allure of trying to unravel the mystery of Clark Kent.

00:40:33.670 --> 00:40:36.670
I suffered from it once, too.

00:40:36.670 --> 00:40:41.550
When I thought you mattered.

00:40:41.550 --> 00:40:42.550
Are we done?

00:40:42.550 --> 00:40:54.469
Nothing left but the formalities.

00:40:54.469 --> 00:40:57.469
Don't look so surprised, Clark.

00:40:57.469 --> 00:40:59.469
Lana still cares about you. I know that.

00:40:59.469 --> 00:41:01.820
And I know that.

00:41:01.820 --> 00:41:02.820
would mean to her having you there.

00:41:02.820 --> 00:41:09.099
Is that really what you want, Lex?

00:41:09.099 --> 00:41:16.519
I want is to make Lana happy for the rest of her life.

00:41:16.519 --> 00:41:20.760
You to be there on our wedding day.

00:41:20.760 --> 00:41:25.170
To see what you lost.

00:41:25.170 --> 00:41:29.900
Make sure you are our CP.

00:41:29.900 --> 00:41:32.900
We need a head count for the reception.

00:41:32.900 --> 00:41:34.900
It's true.

00:41:34.900 --> 00:41:41.860
One day, somehow thought we...

00:41:41.860 --> 00:41:43.860
Exactly what to do.

